# Installed Ansible collections — vendored into collections_path (./collections) by
# `ansible-galaxy collection install -r requirements.yml`. Thousands of files, fully
# re-installable. requirements.yml is the tracked source of truth; the install dir is not.
ansible/collections/ansible_collections/
# Galaxy-installed roles, if a requirements.yml pulls any into ./collections too.
**/ansible_collections/

